              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">�?/span><span>无官�?SLA 保障承诺</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">�?/span><span>Residential �?GB 计费，带宽单价中�?/span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">�?/span><small class="text-slate-500">注：官网为单页购物站点，详细信息有限</small></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
